WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.082 --> 00:00:05.326
The elephant and the raptor stared at the lion.

2
00:00:06.006 --> 00:00:08.229
Wukong is alive inside you," said the raptor.

3
00:00:12.473 --> 00:00:27.988
"Aren't you worried?"

4
00:00:28.208 --> 00:00:29.789
lion sat down on his throne.

5
00:00:29.809 --> 00:00:31.230
"Worried about what?"

6
00:00:32.450 --> 00:00:34.111
"Well," said the raptor.

7
00:00:34.971 --> 00:00:36.992
monkey is talking inside you.

8
00:00:37.993 --> 00:00:39.393
Doesn't that bother you?"

9
00:00:40.994 --> 00:00:43.535
him talk," said the lion defiantly.

10
00:00:43.555 --> 00:00:46.416
"It doesn't bother me at all."

11
00:00:47.497 --> 00:00:48.437
shall I talk about?"

12
00:00:48.637 --> 00:00:49.598
Wukong called.

13
00:00:49.618 --> 00:00:51.478
"Who wants to hear a story?"

14
00:00:52.719 --> 00:00:54.580
The elephant shook his head slowly.

15
00:00:55.936 --> 00:00:58.178
if the monkey never stops talking?

16
00:00:59.059 --> 00:01:00.640
You'll never get any sleep."

17
00:01:03.343 --> 00:01:04.083
said the lion.

18
00:01:04.103 --> 00:01:05.945
"That would be bad."

19
00:01:06.966 --> 00:01:08.047
He thought for a moment.

20
00:01:09.568 --> 00:01:10.249
know what to do.

21
00:01:10.849 --> 00:01:11.890
I'll stop eating."

22
00:01:14.012 --> 00:01:15.213
"What will that do?"

23
00:01:15.613 --> 00:01:16.474
asked the elephant.

24
00:01:17.595 --> 00:01:19.236
"Yes," said Wukong.

25
00:01:19.256 --> 00:01:20.578
"What will that do?"

26
00:01:22.299 --> 00:01:26.206
I don't eat, Wukong doesn't eat," said the lion.

27
00:01:26.226 --> 00:01:28.667
"I'll make him starve."

28
00:01:30.708 --> 00:01:34.291
laughed. "Nice try, lion!

29
00:01:34.651 --> 00:01:37.172
But I'll just turn one of my hairs into a stove.

30
00:01:38.213 --> 00:01:39.914
I'll cook a nice meal in here!"

31
00:01:39.934 --> 00:01:43.196
"Oh dear."

32
00:01:43.436 --> 00:01:44.677
The raptor shook his head.

33
00:01:44.697 --> 00:01:49.760
"If that monkey fires up a stove, it will make you very hot.

34
00:01:51.232 --> 00:01:53.373
Plus it will create lots of smoke.

35
00:01:54.173 --> 00:01:58.894
The smoke will fill your head, and you'll never stop sneezing!"

36
00:02:01.395 --> 00:02:04.076
At last the lion was starting to look nervous.

37
00:02:05.156 --> 00:02:06.656
would be terrible," he said.

38
00:02:06.676 --> 00:02:09.737
"I'd better cough out Wukong."

39
00:02:11.698 --> 00:02:13.358
The lion went to the middle of the room.

40
00:02:14.238 --> 00:02:15.919
He bent over and coughed.

41
00:02:20.224 --> 00:02:21.165
"Ahugh! Ahugh!"

42
00:02:21.945 --> 00:02:24.127
laughed. "I'm still in here!"

43
00:02:24.207 --> 00:02:29.030
"Ahugh! Ahugh!"

44
00:02:29.370 --> 00:02:30.591
The lion coughed again.

45
00:02:31.352 --> 00:02:33.733
But still Wukong stayed inside him.

46
00:02:33.753 --> 00:02:39.257
"I'm going to practice my fighting skills," announced the monkey.

47
00:02:41.439 --> 00:02:42.439
Pow! Boomph!

48
00:02:42.879 --> 00:02:46.422
Pow! Wukong punched and kicked inside the lion.

49
00:02:47.643 --> 00:02:49.064
The lion fell to his knees.

50
00:02:50.980 --> 00:02:51.560
he moaned.

51
00:02:51.580 --> 00:02:53.141
"It hurts!

52
00:02:53.841 --> 00:02:54.661
It hurts!

53
00:02:55.422 --> 00:02:57.242
Wukong, please stop!"

54
00:02:58.662 --> 00:03:00.943
"Let's make a deal," said Wukong.

55
00:03:00.963 --> 00:03:04.744
"I'll come out if you promise to let us cross the mountain safely."

56
00:03:06.404 --> 00:03:08.745
lion looked up at the raptor and the elephant.

57
00:03:09.385 --> 00:03:10.325
They both nodded.

58
00:03:11.686 --> 00:03:13.266
"We promise."

59
00:03:13.726 --> 00:03:14.947
The lion moaned again.

60
00:03:17.067 --> 00:03:18.328
then," said Wukong.

61
00:03:18.968 --> 00:03:20.848
"I'm coming out."

62
00:03:21.469 --> 00:03:24.271
Wukong started the climb up the lion's throat.

63
00:03:25.131 --> 00:03:29.074
Just as he reached the lion's mouth, Wukong heard whispering.

64
00:03:29.094 --> 00:03:32.836
"Lion, I have a plan," whispered the elephant.

65
00:03:32.856 --> 00:03:37.259
"When Wukong tries to come out of your mouth, bite him."

66
00:03:37.279 --> 00:03:40.622
"I don't know whispered the lion.

67
00:03:41.923 --> 00:03:42.923
is very strong.

68
00:03:43.424 --> 00:03:44.824
My belly still hurts."

69
00:03:45.785 --> 00:03:49.748
"Chomp him quickly, before he can fight back," whispered the elephant.

70
00:03:50.528 --> 00:03:52.349
"Okay," said the lion.

71
00:03:52.369 --> 00:03:56.590
"Those dumb demons," thought Wukong.

72
00:03:57.550 --> 00:03:59.170
they realize I can hear them?"

73
00:04:00.091 --> 00:04:01.711
He pulled out his iron bar.

74
00:04:02.711 --> 00:04:03.892
"Shall I come out now?"

75
00:04:04.192 --> 00:04:04.952
asked the monkey.

76
00:04:07.172 --> 00:04:08.913
yes," said the lion.

77
00:04:09.893 --> 00:04:12.314
Wukong heard the three demons snickering.

78
00:04:14.494 --> 00:04:15.315
said Wukong.

79
00:04:15.335 --> 00:04:17.455
"I'm coming out."

80
00:04:18.155 --> 00:04:22.116
He held out the iron bar.

81
00:04:22.176 --> 00:04:24.098
The lion bit down hard on the bar.

82
00:04:26.220 --> 00:04:28.662
A tooth shattered into tiny pieces.

83
00:04:31.905 --> 00:04:33.806
Ow! Ow!"

84
00:04:34.187 --> 00:04:35.828
the lion howled in pain.

85
00:04:37.469 --> 00:04:39.191
Tears streamed down his face.

86
00:04:39.952 --> 00:04:43.875
He rolled around on the floor, holding his paws over his mouth.

87
00:04:45.516 --> 00:04:47.318
villains!" Wukong shouted.

88
00:04:47.338 --> 00:04:50.580
"I heard you whispering!"

89
00:04:50.660 --> 00:04:51.741
"I'm sorry."

90
00:04:52.041 --> 00:04:53.702
The lion was still crying.

91
00:04:54.763 --> 00:04:56.484
won't try to bite you again.

92
00:04:56.504 --> 00:05:00.066
Please don't hurt me anymore."

93
00:05:02.147 --> 00:05:04.888
hesitated. "I'm coming out now.

94
00:05:05.649 --> 00:05:07.930
You'd better not try any more tricks!"

95
00:05:07.950 --> 00:05:11.432
"We won't," said the elephant.

96
00:05:12.112 --> 00:05:14.334
"We promise," said the raptor.

97
00:05:15.554 --> 00:05:17.876
Wukong popped out of the lion's nose.

98
00:05:20.416 --> 00:05:23.940
He glared at the demons for a moment and then walked out of the cave.

99
00:05:28.826 --> 00:05:33.152
As soon as the monkey was gone, the elephant turned to the other two demons.

100
00:05:33.172 --> 00:05:38.818
"I have a new plan for capturing the Tang Monk."
